755	     * Stamps the household's member count after this create ({@code householdSize}) onto every member of
756	     * the household - the existing owners that share the deterministic {@code householdId} and the new
757	     * one - so the shared size can be read back from any of them. The count is the number of existing
758	     * members plus the owner being created.
