773	     * The existing owners that belong to the same household as the given owner - those that share its
774	     * deterministic {@code householdId}. This is the single definition of "who is in this household",
775	     * shared by the household-size stamp and the membership-level cap. The owner being created is not
776	     * among them (it has not been saved yet); soft-deleted owners are included, so callers that need
777	     * only live members filter them out themselves.
